    "Panels have equal height and are separated by full rows of 5. Colour 5 is never used inside a panel.",
    "No panel row is uniform unless it is all 0 and 0 is strictly the most frequent colour of the input. This keeps the separators unambiguous.",
    "Stair tiles have at least one base cell in every row and every column, and at least one 0.",
    "The moving object never reaches the grid border, even in the output panel. Bars start with length >= step, and motifs start at least `step` columns from the edge.",
